  "rules": [
    "Boy | Girl: each gender keeps its own picks (switching gender never resets the other gender's look). The saved avatar = {gender, picks of that gender}.",
    "Outfit drives two layers: outfit-back (file `backFile`, drawn first, behind the body) and outfit-front (`file`). Most outfits have an empty back layer (backFile null); only Hoodie has one.",
    "Girl Hair drives two layers: hair-back (`backFile`, the very bottom layer, behind the outfit) and hair-front (`file`). Every girl hair style has both.",
    "Options with `none: true` (Beard None, Eyewear None, Accessory None) draw nothing for that layer.",
    "\"Buns show through the beanie by design\": Top bun and Messy bun draw the bun in the hair-back layer (reaching up to rig y 85 / 76) while the Beanie (accessory layer, above hair-front) starts at y 112, so the bun pokes out above the beanie. Just draw the layers in order; never hide or mask anything when Beanie is picked.",
    "Base layers (body, shadow, face, nose) are always drawn.",
    "Line colour #0A0A0A and white fills are baked into the art (same as the Open Peeps heads); never tint."
  ]
}